            "review_title": "Review at BA GÁC Vietnamese Grill & Beer",
            "review_text": "Matthieu M\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst food experience in Saigon\nMay 2025 • Friends\nThe Worst Food in Saigon – A Total Nightmare\n\nI’ve lived in Saigon for 5 years. This is, without question, the worst place I’ve ever eaten.\n\nThe ribs were disgusting — dry, old, and tasted like rotten meat. The smell was awful. I almost threw up after the first bite.\n\nI don’t know how this place is still open. It’s not just bad — it’s dangerous.\n\nAvoid this place like the plague. You’ve been warned.\nRead more\nWritten May 8, 2025",
